                    task.getTaskId(),
                    workflow.toShortString(),
                    name);
        } catch (Exception ae) {

            task.setStatus(TaskModel.Status.FAILED);
            task.setReasonForIncompletion(ae.getMessage());
            LOGGER.error(
                    "Error starting sub workflow: {} from workflow: {}",
